  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"RequestParamMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>RequestParamMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"RequestParamMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>RequestParamMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>useDefaultResolution</code> - in default resolution mode a method argument\nthat is a simple type, as defined in <a href=\"../../../beans/BeanUtils.html#isSimpleProperty(java.lang.Class)\"><code>BeanUtils.isSimpleProperty(Class)</code></a>,\nis treated as a request parameter even if it isn't annotated, the\nrequest parameter name is derived from the method parameter name.",
      "translation": "<code>useDefaultResolution</code> - 在默认解析模式下，即使未添加注解，只要方法参数是 <a href=\"../../../beans/BeanUtils.html#isSimpleProperty(java.lang.Class)\"><code>BeanUtils.isSimpleProperty(Class)</code></a> 中定义的简单类型，该参数即被视为请求参数；请求参数的名称由方法参数名称推导得出。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parameter</code> - the method parameter",
      "translation": "<code>parameter</code> - 方法参数",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>request</code> - the current request",
      "translation": "<code>request</code> - 当前请求",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "If the method parameter type is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>, the name specified in the\nannotation is used to resolve the request parameter String value. The value is\nthen converted to a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> via type conversion assuming a suitable\n<a href=\"../../../core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyEditor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyEditor</code></a> has been registered.\nOr if a request parameter name is not specified the\n<a href=\"RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> is used instead to provide\naccess to all request parameters in the form of a map.",
      "translation": "如果方法参数类型为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，则使用注解中指定的名称来解析请求参数字符串值。该值随后通过类型转换转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，前提是已注册了合适的 <a href=\"../../../core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyEditor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyEditor</code></a>。或者，如果未指定请求参数名称，则使用 <a href=\"RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> 来以映射的形式访问所有请求参数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> is invoked to apply type conversion to resolved request\nheader values that don't yet match the method parameter type.",
      "translation": "一个 `<a href=\"../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a>` 被调用，以将类型转换应用于尚未匹配方法参数类型的已解析请求头值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Supports the following:\n<ul>\n<li>@RequestParam-annotated method arguments.\nThis excludes <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> params where the annotation does not specify a name.\nSee <a href=\"RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> instead for such params.\n</li><li>Arguments of type <a href=\"../../multipart/MultipartFile.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.multipart\"><code>MultipartFile</code></a> unless annotated with @<a href=\"../../bind/annotation/RequestPart.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>RequestPart</code></a>.\n</li><li>Arguments of type <code>Part</code> unless annotated with @<a href=\"../../bind/annotation/RequestPart.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>RequestPart</code></a>.\n</li><li>In default resolution mode, simple type arguments even if not with @<a href=\"../../bind/annotation/RequestParam.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>RequestParam</code></a>.\n</li></ul>",
      "translation": "支持以下内容：\n<ul>\n<li>@RequestParam 注解的方法参数。\n这排除了未指定名称的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 参数。\n对于此类参数，请参见 <a href=\"RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>。\n</li><li>类型为 <a href=\"../../multipart/MultipartFile.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.multipart\"><code>MultipartFile</code></a> 的参数，除非带有 @<a href=\"../../bind/annotation/RequestPart.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>RequestPart</code></a> 注解。\n</li><li>类型为 <code>Part</code> 的参数，除非带有 @<a href=\"../../bind/annotation/RequestPart.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>RequestPart</code></a> 注解。\n</li><li>在默认解析模式下，即使没有 @<a href=\"../../bind/annotation/RequestParam.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>RequestParam</code></a> 注解的简单类型参数。\n</li></ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"AbstractNamedValueMethodArgumentResolver.html#handleMissingValue(java.lang.String,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest)\">AbstractNamedValueMethodArgumentResolver</a></code></span>",
