      "source": "Process the given method argument and either update the\n<a href=\"../../util/UriComponentsBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.util\"><code>UriComponentsBuilder</code></a> or add to the map with URI variables\nto use to expand the URI after all arguments are processed.",
